      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow, that's heavy. it really shows how much fear was driving things back then. i think the part about changing the fabric of the town is really strong. do you think they would also talk about how 'dangerous' or 'untrustworthy' people are if they aren't part of their social class? just trying to see if they'd express those specific kinds of prejudices in their conversation.",
